# FitNova AI backend

This folder contains the shared FastAPI backend for the project.
Each team member should work inside their own feature branch and add code in the appropriate modules.


### 3. Citations & Official Guidelines Links

Here are the official links to the documents defining the parameters in your knowledge base. You should download the PDFs from these links and place them in your `data/` folder.

* **Pakistan Dietary Guidelines for Better Nutrition (FAO & Gov of Pakistan, 2018):**
[https://www.fao.org/3/ca1472en/ca1472en.pdf](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.fao.org/3/ca1472en/ca1472en.pdf)
* **WHO Asian BMI Cut-offs (Expert Consultation, 2004):**
[https://www.who.int/nutrition/publications/bmi_asia_strategies.pdf](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.who.int/nutrition/publications/bmi_asia_strategies.pdf)
* **ISSN Position Stand - Protein and Exercise (2017):**
[https://jissn.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s12970-017-0177-8](https://jissn.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s12970-017-0177-8)
* **WHO Guidelines on Physical Activity and Sedentary Behaviour (2020):**
[https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240015128](https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240015128)
* **NIH / JAMA Step Count & Mortality Study (2020):**
[https://jamanetwork.com/journals/jama/fullarticle/2763292](https://jamanetwork.com/journals/jama/fullarticle/2763292)

---

**Verified Reference Sources and Official Links**

| Topic / Domain | Governing Body / Landmark Study | Direct Link |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR)** | Mifflin-St Jeor Equation (1990) / Academy of Nutrition and Dietetics | [PubMed Validation Study](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2305711/) |
| **Global Activity Standards** | World Health Organization (WHO, 2020 Guidelines) | [WHO Physical Activity & Sedentary Behaviour Guidelines](https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240014886) |
| **Protein Requirements** | International Society of Sports Nutrition (ISSN Position Stand) | [JISSN Protein and Exercise Stand (PMC)](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2117006/) |
| **Hydration & Electrolytes** | American College of Sports Medicine (ACSM Position Stand) | [ACSM Fluid Replacement Guidelines (PubMed)](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17277604/) |
| **Regional Anthropometrics** | WHO Expert Consultation on Asian BMI Cut-Offs (2004) | [The Lancet / PMC Evaluation Report](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4217157/) |

**Comprehensive Scope for Nutrition, Fitness, and Exercise**

* **Universal Coverage**: Fully equipped to process, analyze, and answer any category of inquiry spanning clinical nutrition, sports metabolism, macro/micronutrient periodization, resistance training programming, hypertrophy mechanisms, fatigue mitigation (DOMS), sleep architecture, and hydration kinetics.
* **Conditional Citation Rule**: Empirical references, peer-reviewed literature, and institutional guidelines remain hidden during standard responses to maintain conversational fluency and are provided explicitly only when requested.
